WEBVTT

NOTE
03-soma: no speech in this video.
A music bed with interface ticks, plus a thud on the closing card.
Captions describe what is on screen.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.867
[quiet music] One form, mid submission.

2
00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.200
Soma. The busywork runs itself.

3
00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:06.333
One customer fills in one form.

4
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.667
Name, phone, service.
That is the whole input.

5
00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:15.033
Watch what lands after they hit send.

6
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.367
The CRM row writes itself.
No copy and paste.

7
00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:23.700
The confirmation email goes out
while you are still on the job.

8
00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:28.067
The payment link is already waiting.

9
00:00:28.533 --> 00:00:32.400
Four tools moved. You touched none of them.

10
00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:36.733
Pick your four tools first.
The order they fire in is the build.

11
00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:39.733
Every step shows its own status,
so you watch it work instead of hoping.

12
00:00:39.733 --> 00:00:43.333
One submission triggers everything after it.
Same at 3pm and at 3am.

13
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:46.933
[low thud] Set it once. It just runs.
